<h3>Report editor</h3>

<p>
    The <strong>report editor</strong> is the function to create and edit reports.
</p>
<p>
    The <strong>report editor</strong> shows the enviroment to develop custom reports.
</p>
<h4>Editor commands</h4>
<table>
    <tr><td><i class="Icon fa fa-line-columns"></i></td><td>Columns List contains the list of the columns extracted by the report.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><i class="Icon fa fa-filter"></i></td><td>Filters List allows the configuration of filters to be used to filter  data of the report.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><i class="Icon fa fa-users"></i></td><td>Granted groups allows to specified the groups authorized to launch the current report.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Code</td><td>Code of the current report.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Source</td><td>Source codes of the current report , that can be Custom, Audit Trail, Instances, Prototypes and Users.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Online</td><td> Flag to be checked to make the report available in Report viewer.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Description</td><td>Description for the current report.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Query</td><td>Field where the query to extract the data of the report must be specified.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Creation</td><td>The user, date and time of creation of the record.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Last edit</td><td>The user, date and time of the last modification of the record.</td></tr>
</table>
<table>
    <tr><td>VERIFY</td><td>Verifies the current report configuration.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>VIEW</td><td>Views the current report on the report viewer.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>SAVE</td><td>Saves the changes of the report.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>DELETE</td><td>Deletes a <strong>draft</strong> report.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>QUIT</td><td>Closes the report editor and returns to the page report list.</td></tr>
</table>